 "note": "Thomas C. Passios Elementary School faculty for 1996-1997: the narrative above names the Passios Elementary School and the 'FACULTY / 1996 - 1997' heading (lines 22-23) follows it. Lines 1-16 are the principal's narrative; lines 17-21 are the Elementary School Advisory Council (principal, teachers, parents, community representative) -- a council, not staff, so ignored even though some members also appear in the faculty list. Line 52 is the page number. Two columns, each a label and a name (x 0.12/0.27 and 0.48/0.69); a label governs the names below it until the next label. Office labels (Principal, Asst. Prin., Secretary) go in role_raw; grade and subject labels go in grade_or_dept, as in the 2003 Passios page. Line 36 prints 'Janet Marshall *' and line 37 '(*replacing Jan Van de Water)': the asterisk is dropped from the name, and Jan Van de Water -- the person replaced, not a staff member on this list -- is not recorded; line 37 is claimed by Allison Weiss (Speech/Lang.) in the right column. '(Prim.)' and '(Pri.)' after a name are kept in role_raw as printed. The faculty list continues on page 41 (Grade 4)."
